        <say>Judith,</say> I growled in exasperation. <say>This was <emph>your</emph> idea.</say>

        Judith nodded and meekly conceded, <say>The advice I gave you was solid… solid shit. I apologize.</say>

        <say><soft>Thank you,</soft></say> I grumbled through clenched teeth.

        <say>Money for followers was J’s idea?</say> asked Gillian with a sudden lack of condescension.

