        <say>He <emph>used</emph> me to clear their hotel.</say>

        <say>Which <quote>he</quote>?</say>

        <say>Kind. The <emph>mayor.</emph></say>

        <say>Why would Mayor Kind give a damn about the hotel?</say>

        <say>Campaign donations. Which is to say, bribes.</say>

