        <say>It’s not really a <quote>party</quote> though, it’s more like… a <emph>date.</emph></say>

        I chuckled. <say>A 5-person date, I guess that’s one way of viewing it.</say> I pointed at Judy’s door. <say>The first girlfriend visiting us today lives right next door to me.</say>

        <say>The location’s convenient.</say>

