        I slipped my panties off and threw them in the hamper. I returned to her, and observed, <say>Your eyes are <emph>big</emph> right now.</say>

        <say>You took off your panties.</say>

        <say>It gives others easy access. <emph>And</emph> it’s slutty.</say>

