        <say>I know, otherwise I wouldn’t have bothered scheduling anything with her. And it’s also how I know I picked the right domme.</say>

        <say>I’m… glad you think of me as a good domme. Even though we’ve only been doing this for a day.</say>

        <say>If anything, you could stand to be a bit crueler.</say>

