            <msg>And I know how to stay hidden, the other kids picked on me all the time at school so I got lots of practice.</msg>
            <msg>And I’m good with a gun, too.</msg>
          </out>
          <in>
            <from>Mistress</from>
            <msg>we have no idea how many of them there are. there is only one of you.</msg>
          </in>
          <out>
            <from>Me</from>
            <msg>Then I can take someone with me.</msg>
          </out>
          <in>
            <from>Blue</from>
