            <msg>Regina, I only showed you how to shoot a dinky .22 yesterday, not to mention you’ve never been trained in <say-as interpret-as="characters">CQC</say-as>.</msg>
            <msg>Judy, I’ll venture a guess that you have never held a gun in your life.</msg>
            <msg>Am I wrong?</msg>
          </in>
